I remember the recipes.

345
17:01.221 --> 17:03.021
You can supervise me if you want.

346
17:04.421 --> 17:05.620
I'm not paying you, you know.

347
17:06.129 --> 17:07.241
It's fine. No need for it.

348
17:16.776 --> 17:19.304
(Keep Quiet)

349
17:22.461 --> 17:23.261
Why are you back?

350
17:24.300 --> 17:25.221
Haoyu won't see you.

351
17:28.421 --> 17:29.741
How many times must I tell you?

352
17:30.060 --> 17:31.181
He doesn't want to see you.

353
17:31.580 --> 17:32.060
Hui,

354
17:32.941 --> 17:33.701
I came to see you.

355
17:34.140 --> 17:35.060
Give me ten minutes.

356
17:35.820 --> 17:37.100
If you still won't forgive me,

357
17:38.021 --> 17:38.540
I won't

358
17:38.620 --> 17:39.421
bother you again.

359
17:50.696 --> 17:52.552
(Huixin Florist)

360
17:54.280 --> 17:55.816
(Huixin Florist)

361
17:58.820 --> 17:59.421
Let's go in.

362
18:01.261 --> 18:02.060
What is it now?

363
18:02.860 --> 18:03.540
Just humor me

364
18:04.100 --> 18:04.741
and take a look.

365
18:20.872 --> 18:22.888
(Huixin Florist)

366
18:34.953 --> 18:35.691
Do you like it?

367
18:36.100 --> 18:36.540
What?

368
18:37.901 --> 18:38.620
Now you remember

369
18:38.741 --> 18:39.741
what flowers I like?

370
18:40.421 --> 18:41.860
I've always remembered, Hui.

371
18:42.540 --> 18:43.540
Back when we were crammed

372
18:43.661 --> 18:44.941
in that tiny place in Xiaocheng,

373
18:45.461 --> 18:46.181
you told me

374
18:46.741 --> 18:47.896
you wanted your own florist

375
18:48.340 --> 18:49.580
to smell flowers every day

376
18:50.421 --> 18:51.421
and live a peaceful life.

377
18:52.100 --> 18:53.261
I promised you right then

378
18:53.820 --> 18:55.140
that when I made it,

379
18:55.860 --> 18:57.140
I'd make that dream come true.

380
18:57.661 --> 18:59.181
So many years have passed.

381
19:00.100 --> 19:00.860
What's the point

382
19:00.941 --> 19:01.820
of bringing it up now?

383
19:02.461 --> 19:04.340
It matters to me.

384
19:04.780 --> 19:07.100
I strayed too far over the years.

385
19:07.941 --> 19:09.340
So far I almost forgot who I was,

386
19:10.661 --> 19:11.340
almost forgot

387
19:11.461 --> 19:12.340
how I started.

388
19:13.901 --> 19:14.540
Whenever I felt

389
19:14.540 --> 19:15.461
like giving up,

390
19:16.100 --> 19:16.981
I thought of you

391
19:17.981 --> 19:18.941
and how you said

392
19:19.620 --> 19:20.300
that when we

393
19:20.300 --> 19:21.221
had our own shop,

394
19:22.421 --> 19:23.981
you'd put two chairs out front,

395
19:24.540 --> 19:25.300
one for me

396
19:26.300 --> 19:27.140
and one for Haoyu.

397
19:29.580 --> 19:30.620
Don't you feel ridiculous

398
19:31.501 --> 19:32.461
saying this now?

399
19:35.941 --> 19:36.820
It is ridiculous.

400
19:39.461 --> 19:41.181
I clawed my way to the top all these years,

401
19:42.100 --> 19:43.780
thinking money and status

402
19:44.501 --> 19:45.501
would give you and Haoyu

403
19:45.620 --> 19:46.580
the best life.

404
19:47.780 --> 19:48.540
Yet in the end,

405
19:49.820 --> 19:50.901
I lost what mattered

406
19:50.981 --> 19:51.620
most to me.

407
19:54.021 --> 19:54.661
I rebuilt

408
19:55.221 --> 19:56.285
this place piece by piece,

409
19:56.580 --> 19:57.860
based on the photo

410
19:58.060 --> 19:58.981
inside your notebook.

411
20:04.860 --> 20:05.620
All of my money

412
20:06.661 --> 20:07.580
is on this card.

413
20:08.461 --> 20:09.221
Just say the word,

414
20:09.858 --> 20:11.109
and everything I have is yours.

415
20:13.060 --> 20:13.981
Buying forgiveness?

416
20:15.380 --> 20:15.860
Di Liren,

417
20:17.501 --> 20:18.820
you really haven't changed a bit.

418
20:19.421 --> 20:19.741
No.

419
20:21.140 --> 20:21.901
I'm paying it back.

420
20:23.080 --> 20:27.176
♪She say it's a mistake from the start♪

421
20:27.816 --> 20:32.616
♪Yet love leaves her unable to move forward♪

422
20:32.936 --> 20:37.672
♪Hands that can't let go, caught in between♪

423
20:37.992 --> 20:42.696
♪Love and reluctance, half of each remains♪

424
20:44.580 --> 20:45.060
Hui,

425
20:46.340 --> 20:47.421
when we got married,

426
20:48.221 --> 20:49.181
I couldn't even afford

427
20:49.181 --> 20:49.860
a decent ring.

428
20:50.501 --> 20:51.421
Over the years,

429
20:51.540 --> 20:52.461
passing a jewelry store

430
20:53.181 --> 20:54.072
always made me wonder

431
20:54.901 --> 20:55.540
how wonderful

432
20:55.661 --> 20:57.097
it'd be to give you a real wedding.

433
20:58.021 --> 20:58.540
I know

434
20:59.661 --> 21:01.100
I've made many mistakes,

435
21:02.221 --> 21:03.021
making you and Haoyu

436
21:03.181 --> 21:04.021
suffer so much.

437
21:04.540 --> 21:05.901
You don't have to forgive me now,

438
21:06.540 --> 21:07.346
but at least give me

439
21:07.421 --> 21:08.671
a chance to make it up to you.

440
21:09.221 --> 21:10.620
Let me be your husband again,

441
21:11.100 --> 21:11.941
Haoyu's father,

442
21:12.421 --> 21:13.661
a partner in this flower shop,

443
21:15.800 --> 21:16.540
and the Fang Yong

444
21:16.540 --> 21:18.181
who promised to protect you forever.

445
21:18.181 --> 21:23.400
♪Her tears vanish without a trace♪

446
21:40.776 --> 21:42.060
(Holder: Di Liren)

447
21:42.060 --> 21:42.461
Thank you.

448
21:49.416 --> 21:50.216
(Marriage Registration Center)

449
21:56.840 --> 21:58.536
(Marriage Registration)

450
22:04.860 --> 22:05.380
Meng,

451
22:05.461 --> 22:06.701
congrats on being single again.

452
22:11.820 --> 22:12.981
You guys even prepared this?

453
22:13.100 --> 22:14.901
Someone insisted on a proper ceremony.

454
22:20.021 --> 22:20.673
To a new life.

455
22:20.981 --> 22:21.501
To freedom.

456
22:21.820 --> 22:22.340
To...

457
22:25.960 --> 22:28.168
(Marriage Registration)

458
22:32.820 --> 22:33.620
What a scumbag.

459
22:33.901 --> 22:34.981
The ink's not even dry

460
22:35.021 --> 22:35.946
on the divorce papers.

461
22:36.661 --> 22:37.741
Has Lu Hui lost her mind?

462
22:53.661 --> 22:54.140
She hasn't.

463
22:56.300 --> 22:57.701
Di Liren ruined Harry like that.

464
22:58.580 --> 22:59.300
There must be

465
22:59.340 --> 23:00.221
something behind

466
23:01.540 --> 23:02.580
her choice to remarry him.

467
23:15.140 --> 23:16.820
Leave the package at the door, thanks.

468
23:17.580 --> 23:18.140
This delivery

469
23:18.261 --> 23:19.461
needs your personal signature.

470
23:21.421 --> 23:22.140
Dr. Kang?

471
23:22.540 --> 23:23.540
Why not use my lab

472
23:23.860 --> 23:24.741
for your new products?

473
23:28.808 --> 23:30.504
(Resume)

474
23:30.504 --> 23:31.580
(Zhao Xue)

475
23:31.580 --> 23:33.221
Jumping ship with the whole R&amp;D team?

476
23:33.661 --> 23:34.661
Will Di Liren let you go?

477
23:34.860 --> 23:35.421
Did you forget

478
23:35.461 --> 23:36.060
the contract?

479
23:36.540 --> 23:37.221
That contract

480
23:37.380 --> 23:38.461
has no real hold on me.

481
23:40.540 --> 23:41.221
So, Dr. Kang,

482
23:41.300 --> 23:42.661
are you looking for an investor?

483
23:42.661 --> 23:44.461
A fearless partner.

484
23:46.060 --> 23:47.181
I'm not good at operations.

485
23:47.620 --> 23:48.941
I just want to focus on research

486
23:49.461 --> 23:50.100
with my team.

487
23:50.661 --> 23:51.570
So here's my proposal:

488
23:51.981 --> 23:52.901
the lab does R&amp;D,

489
23:53.100 --> 23:54.060
and you run operations.

490
23:54.300 --> 23:54.941
We share results

491
23:55.140 --> 23:55.981
and split decisions.

492
23:57.060 --> 23:57.661
Think it over.

493
24:00.168 --> 24:01.288
(Kanglong R&amp;D Lab Technical Development Partnership Contract)

494
24:01.512 --> 24:03.540
♪A miracle♪

495
24:03.540 --> 24:04.820
To a successful partnership

496
24:05.221 --> 24:05.741
in advance.

497
24:06.789 --> 24:07.847
A successful partnership.

498
24:10.981 --> 24:12.261
Are you two done talking?

499
24:12.580 --> 24:13.060
Zi?

500
24:13.860 --> 24:15.021
I heard a businesswoman

501
24:15.100 --> 24:16.221
wants to go solo.

502
24:16.461 --> 24:17.140
Shouldn't you ask

503
24:17.140 --> 24:18.181
if we're on board first?

504
24:19.580 --> 24:20.860
Ding? Mr. Dong?

505
24:21.261 --> 24:21.661
You...

506
24:22.340 --> 24:22.780
Ms. Yu,

507
24:23.261 --> 24:24.380
care to sign for us

508
24:24.580 --> 24:25.580
as a package deal?

509
24:26.701 --> 24:27.860
To celebrate Meng launching

510
24:27.941 --> 24:28.741
her new venture.

511
24:30.901 --> 24:31.860
Thank you.

512
24:32.780 --> 24:33.701
Thank you, Mr. Dong.

513
24:37.221 --> 24:38.421
The boss's first task:

514
24:38.941 --> 24:39.901
name the company.

515
24:41.300 --> 24:41.901
Wait a second.

516
24:42.380 --> 24:43.540
I need to film this.

517
24:48.661 --> 24:50.501
Then I'll call it...

518
24:50.888 --> 24:55.528
♪Every choice brings me closer to♪

519
24:56.072 --> 24:57.992
♪A miracle♪

520
25:00.261 --> 25:01.060
Yueji.

521
25:01.060 --> 25:02.261
Congratulations, Ms. Yu!

522
25:03.060 --> 25:04.221
Let's take a group photo.

523
25:06.661 --> 25:07.860
One, two, three.

524
25:10.140 --> 25:11.032
(Starting a business)

525
25:11.300 --> 25:12.620
(is only one part of my life.)

526
25:13.300 --> 25:14.221
(I'll keep exploring)

527
25:14.221 --> 25:15.072
(more possibilities.)

528
25:15.941 --> 25:16.820
(We used to live)

529
25:16.860 --> 25:18.100
(in scripts written by others.)

530
25:19.060 --> 25:19.820
(From now on,)

531
25:20.300 --> 25:20.860
(we will walk)

532
25:20.860 --> 25:22.021
(beside kindred spirits,)

533
25:22.620 --> 25:23.380
(pleasing no one)

534
25:23.901 --> 25:24.540
(but ourselves.)

535
25:25.221 --> 25:26.300
Dr. Kang's team's leaving

536
25:26.461 --> 25:27.820
did stem from Han Guang meddling

537
25:27.941 --> 25:29.140
with the new patent.

538
25:29.741 --> 25:30.701
Han Guang didn't know

539
25:30.820 --> 25:31.780
the details of Jiali's deal

540
25:31.780 --> 25:32.421
with Dr. Kang,

541
25:32.820 --> 25:33.780
leaving a loophole.

542
25:34.941 --> 25:36.021
I don't care about excuses.

543
25:37.195 --> 25:38.300
Kang Long took the new patent

544
25:38.300 --> 25:39.100
and the core team

545
25:39.340 --> 25:40.380
straight to Yu Meng.

546
25:41.181 --> 25:42.580
The company took a massive blow

547
25:42.701 --> 25:43.941
in talent, tech, and capital.

548
25:45.941 --> 25:47.461
Morale is plummeting inside,

549
25:47.981 --> 25:49.181
competitors are mocking us,

550
25:50.221 --> 25:51.060
and it has severely

551
25:51.140 --> 25:52.300
damaged Jiali's brand image.

552
25:53.021 --> 25:54.181
What solutions

553
25:54.620 --> 25:55.620
are you proposing?

554
25:56.300 --> 25:56.981
We recommend

555
25:57.100 --> 25:58.181
a lawsuit against Yu Meng,

556
25:58.580 --> 25:59.140
suing her

557
25:59.421 --> 26:00.889
for intentional harm to the company

558
26:01.021 --> 26:02.221
or unfair competition.

559
26:03.340 --> 26:03.820
Will we win?

560
26:04.461 --> 26:05.100
Honestly,

561
26:05.501 --> 26:07.141
with thin evidence, the odds are slim.

562
26:09.540 --> 26:09.860
Sue her.

563
26:10.860 --> 26:12.060
Sue her for everything we can.

564
26:13.060 --> 26:14.820
As long as Yueji is buried in lawsuits,

565
26:15.340 --> 26:17.300
every investor will hesitate.

566
26:18.461 --> 26:19.261
Even if we lose,

567
26:20.060 --> 26:21.340
I'll drag it out and bleed them.

568
26:21.943 --> 26:22.467
Understood.

569
26:22.820 --> 26:23.820
I found the person

570
26:23.941 --> 26:24.530
you mentioned.

571
26:24.620 --> 26:25.299
He's Peng Cheng.

572
26:25.501 --> 26:26.780
Like Lu Hui and Di Liren,

573
26:26.901 --> 26:27.800
he's from Xiaocheng.

574
26:27.901 --> 26:28.501
But

575
26:28.620 --> 26:30.380
I need more time to find out the connection

576
26:30.860 --> 26:31.701
between the three.

577
26:34.100 --> 26:35.140
That makes sense.

578
26:36.540 --> 26:37.261
Keep digging.

579
26:37.580 --> 26:38.741
We need conclusive evidence.

580
26:39.580 --> 26:39.981
Sure.

581
26:40.580 --> 26:41.421
How's Yueji doing?

582
26:43.461 --> 26:44.501
Pretty smooth so far.

583
26:44.661 --> 26:45.901
I've already spoken

584
26:46.021 --> 26:46.780
with some VC firms.

585
26:46.941 --> 26:48.620
There's also a cosmetics investor summit

586
26:48.741 --> 26:49.580
coming up.

587
26:49.981 --> 26:51.140
I'll make a pitch there

588
26:51.340 --> 26:52.261
and do my best.

589
26:52.501 --> 26:53.461
Out of all the clients

590
26:53.461 --> 26:54.661
I've ever represented,

591
26:54.820 --> 26:56.340
you went from divorce to a fresh start

592
26:56.461 --> 26:57.421
better than anyone.

593
26:58.221 --> 26:58.941
It's impressive.

594
26:59.060 --> 27:00.181
Of course.

595
27:00.701 --> 27:02.140
I can't just forever dwell

596
27:02.421 --> 27:03.380
on painful memories.

597
27:03.701 --> 27:04.060
Right.

598
27:04.741 --> 27:06.860
I should award you

599
27:07.221 --> 27:08.461
an honorary morale trophy,

600
27:08.820 --> 27:09.780
like a special perk

601
27:09.941 --> 27:11.300
for being such a good client.

602
27:11.741 --> 27:13.261
It wouldn't be something like

603
27:13.421 --> 27:15.021
Best Divorced Client of the Year,

604
27:15.021 --> 27:16.140
would it?

605
27:20.981 --> 27:21.501
Bye.

606
27:30.536 --> 27:32.232
(Voice Recording)

607
27:42.461 --> 27:43.221
Stop blowing that!

608
27:43.701 --> 27:45.261
Stop playing that busted suona horn!

609
27:45.661 --> 27:46.981
Or I'll call the police!

610
28:09.576 --> 28:11.336
(Yu Meng)

611
28:11.592 --> 28:14.280
(Gift for the Boss)

612
28:16.300 --> 28:17.060
What's wrong?

613
28:17.620 --> 28:18.261
You've been

614
28:18.261 --> 28:19.221
signing all morning.

615
28:19.860 --> 28:20.701
Sighing so much

616
28:20.860 --> 28:21.718
scares away fortune.

617
28:23.701 --> 28:26.340
I think I did something stupid.

618
28:31.208 --> 28:32.104
(Discount Alert: Limited-time 5% off...)

619
28:37.461 --> 28:39.261
Listen to this for me.

620
28:46.421 --> 28:46.780
This...

621
28:48.501 --> 28:49.981
This sounds awful.

622
28:51.820 --> 28:52.461
I knew it.

623
28:54.780 --> 28:55.261
No,

624
28:56.100 --> 28:56.780
I need to fix it.

625
29:00.421 --> 29:01.262
Where are you going?

626
29:02.248 --> 29:03.112
(Wu Ta Club New Promo: 1 Drink for 1 Hour of Legal Consultation)

627
29:08.981 --> 29:09.901
Mr. Jiao, you're here.

628
29:11.461 --> 29:12.421
The case is closed.

629
29:12.540 --> 29:13.780
Why are you visiting even more?

630
29:15.140 --> 29:16.701
I'm just here for a coffee.

631
29:21.580 --> 29:22.181
Hello?

632
29:22.981 --> 29:23.701
Delivery?

633
29:25.060 --> 29:25.820
I'm coming.

634
29:25.901 --> 29:26.340
Sit.

635
29:30.501 --> 29:31.661
Did you listen to

636
29:32.461 --> 29:33.181
what I sent you?

637
29:36.060 --> 29:36.620
What was it?

638
29:38.661 --> 29:39.701
Just an audio clip.

639
29:39.780 --> 29:40.780
Delete it if you haven't.

640
29:41.701 --> 29:42.981
I misclicked and sent it

641
29:43.060 --> 29:43.661
by mistake.

642
29:46.661 --> 29:47.780
Then who did you

643
29:48.340 --> 29:49.380
mean to send it to?

644
29:52.360 --> 29:53.640
(Zi)

645
29:59.741 --> 30:01.620
That's a pretty unique ringtone.

646
30:01.780 --> 30:02.512
Where is it from?

647
30:05.540 --> 30:06.140
I found it

648
30:07.461 --> 30:08.060
on the street.

649
30:09.300 --> 30:11.221
On the street?

650
30:12.140 --> 30:13.661
That street artist

651
30:13.741 --> 30:14.741
really suits your taste.

652
30:15.060 --> 30:15.780
It's so off-key,

653
30:15.780 --> 30:16.972
and she made it her ringtone.

654
30:19.580 --> 30:20.140
It's not bad.

655
30:21.261 --> 30:22.380
I think it's heartfelt.

656
30:23.941 --> 30:24.580
What do you say?

657
30:25.300 --> 30:25.780
Is it good?

658
30:27.140 --> 30:28.380
I think...

659
30:28.981 --> 30:30.100
I think it's okay.

660
30:30.661 --> 30:32.501
Just that on the high notes,

661
30:32.620 --> 30:33.820
there's still a slight flaw.

662
30:35.380 --> 30:36.221
I'll practice more.

663
30:38.261 --> 30:38.780
That depends

664
30:38.780 --> 30:39.661
on your neighbors.

665
30:45.661 --> 30:47.140
Jiali sued Yueji.

666
30:59.820 --> 31:01.140
How is the divorce gift?

667
31:01.661 --> 31:02.181
You like it?

668
31:05.941 --> 31:07.100
Non-compete breach,

669
31:07.421 --> 31:08.580
trade secret infringement,

670
31:09.021 --> 31:10.249
a shareholder derivative suit,

671
31:10.300 --> 31:11.307
and unfair competition.

672
31:12.100 --> 31:12.580
Di Liren,

673
31:12.780 --> 31:14.261
you're suing over everything you can,

674
31:14.261 --> 31:14.620
huh?

675
31:14.941 --> 31:16.221
You missed the key point.

676
31:17.300 --> 31:18.140
I want Haomeng.

677
31:19.620 --> 31:20.860
Quite an appetite.

678
31:21.661 --> 31:22.380
By what right?

679
31:23.221 --> 31:24.181
Because I can sue

680
31:24.261 --> 31:25.780
to void your patent transfer.

681
31:26.701 --> 31:28.140
You were a Jiali shareholder,

682
31:28.580 --> 31:29.820
suspected of abusing your power

683
31:30.181 --> 31:31.314
to buy Haomeng on the cheap.

684
31:31.380 --> 31:31.998
Are you insane?

685
31:32.140 --> 31:32.800
Are you scared?

686
31:33.261 --> 31:34.221
Why should I be scared?

687
31:35.421 --> 31:36.021
Di Liren,

688
31:36.661 --> 31:38.021
did you feel shortchanged

689
31:38.181 --> 31:39.300
